<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:vc="clr-namespace:CoenQcCalibrateValve;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The spouts during a calibration or a delivery, so the drops land as in a session (Pip, 10 Nov 2026). On a rig whose rig.yml has a lick spout stage (ValveRig's HasStage: stepperDriver a and b), Stage runs OpenRigs.Devices HarpLickSpoutStage on StepperDriver-A and -B: it homes every motor and moves the spouts to the in position from PositionsFile (rig.yml's lickSpoutDefaultPosition when that file is not there); once that move has had its time, both radial (in/out) axes go to SpoutsForwardSteps from home (0: they stay in), and SpoutsReady once that move has had its time too. Once the DoneSubjectName subject ends, DoneCommand moves the stage. On a rig without a stage, SpoutsReady at once and nothing moves. Needs the ValveRig and SpoutsReady subjects.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>ValveRig</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Stage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>HasStage</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="PositionsFile" />
        <Property Name="SpoutsForwardSteps" />
        <Property Name="DoneSubjectName" />
        <Property Name="DoneCommand" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Stage</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>StepperDriverA</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>StepperDriver-A</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>StepperDriverB</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="rx:AsyncSubject">
              <Name>StepperDriver-B</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>RigFile</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="PropertyMapping">
              <PropertyMappings>
                <Property Name="RigFile" />
              </PropertyMappings>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="PositionsFile" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:HarpLickSpoutStage.bonsai">
              <RigFile>UNMAPPED</RigFile>
              <PositionsFile />
              <StepSize>150</StepSize>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="RadialSteps" DisplayName="SpoutsForwardSteps" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:SpoutsForward">
                <vc:RadialSteps>0</vc:RadialSteps>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>true</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="DoneSubjectName" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeLast">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Command" DisplayName="DoneCommand" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dev:ToLickSpoutCommand">
                <dev:Command>SpoutsIn</dev:Command>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="0" To="5" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="6" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="10" To="11" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="13" To="14" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="18" To="19" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="19" To="20" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="20" To="22" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="21" To="22" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="22" To="23" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="23" To="24" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>ValveRig</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>NoStage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
              <Selector>HasStage</Selector>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="BitwiseNot" />
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
          <Value>true</Value>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
